https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618251_1918923745671989_8890095879017026427_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xtAAsu_x0okQ7kNvwE50Yqp&_nc_oc=Adr-WafogkiEAFFMDSTBq8IWY1rkGNg1_lePmLqctXBrOu1URuAhAOspAzy8P2Dm50s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQU5CzmxNbu1jW-IyeaK2IRwxnMNNBuCOq-3Bo2ZSTFyw&oe=6AECA5BA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "KV\u5efa\u6a21\u7248-\u6a2a\u7248\u5e26\u6587\u6848.png", "id": "2933852970137565", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617850_2933852973470898_1269573226902913604_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GE-3Q20FiI8Q7kNvwFJHXdB&_nc_oc=Adp7fLcswIslb36uZ3x5b7i0I07oDOHHRMZyEeFryAxJC6OPSiIFypYpcNQ8-cWe9v0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRAHJOXqRtH7GdKiQrFG6htzJJOAcCpuqdbEC7te9z8HQ&oe=6AEC8621"}, "display_name": "Grab & Run Alpaca party", "keywords": ["hangout", "multiplayer"], "long_description": "##  This is ** Grab & Run**, the physics-powered extraction multiplayer VR adventure where maps reshape every time, every stuff has real weight, monsters keep you alert, and an upgrade system makes each run hit even better, while you and your friends stay just the right amount of chaotic, and new surprises drop all the time.\n\n---\n---\n\n\n## \ud83c\udf92 **Grab \u2192 Fight \u2192 Return Loop**\nEnter room \u2192 grab shiny stuff \u2192 fight monsters \u2192 push stuff home, classic extraction loop, Alpaca edition.  \nThe more valuable the grab, the harder it gets.  **High risk. Big shiny.**\n\n---\n{1410467900510234}\n\n## \u2699\ufe0f **Physics Chaos**\nEverything heavy. Everything move. Push cart fast, stuff fly off.  \nNot bug, physics working hard.  Too heavy? Roll it into cart. \n\nEfficiency? Maybe. Fun? Definitely.\n\n---\n{1579468509903297}\n\n## \ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f **Every run is a new world**\nNew room combos, new routes, new monsters, every single run.  \nYou might get a little lost and run into wandering monsters, just consider it part of the adventure.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udc79 **Many Monster. Then BIG BOSS.**\nDifferent monsters wander around.  Every few levels, big boss show up.  \nGet friends and fight together. Fun.\n\n---\n{847706171298747}\n\n## \ud83d\udcaa **Get coins, get stronger**\nGrab coins to upgrade your stats, boost your runs, and become big strong alpaca.  \nMore gear, more builds, more chaos coming.  **Final form not reached yet.**\n\n\n{25371341385839390}\n---\n## \ud83d\udd27 **Feedback & Updates**\nWe update the game often and keep improving it based on your feedback.  \nYou speak, we hear. Join our Discord, play with the community:  \n**discord.gg/fXzg8gwrpr**\n\n\n", "short_description": "This is Grab & Run, the physics-powered extraction multiplayer VR adventure where maps reshape every time, every stuff has real weight, monsters keep you alert, and an upgrade system makes each run hit even better, while you and your friends stay just the right amount of chaotic, new surprises drop all the time."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1G2lTbooVez5146G8ER7dBPNAw-xLTALwRUWbCwmp9j4/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Netvios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://netvios.163.com/en/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1700921480735423"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": [], "id": "25407354645602759"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1562344358151926"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1562344358151926"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1769166780, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1562344358151926"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "28781102991561224", "version": "1.16.12"}, "id": "4201197503539639", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24653500707654827", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28781102991561224"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "4201197503539639"}]}, "change_log": "# Release Notes\n\n## New Content\n- Added treasure \"Gas Can\"\n- Added Halloween scene decorations and ornaments\n- Added storyboard frames (11 types)\n- Added quick pickup function for equipment slots\n\n## Optimizations and Adjustments\n- Adjust bullet stack quantity\n- Optimize slot machine prize pool probability distribution and draw prices\n- Optimize slot machine quantity display and error prompts\n- Optimize material generation configuration, dynamically limit the maximum number of frames generated\n- Adjusted the trigger activation angle for the equipment bar for easier grabbing.\n- Adjust watch position\n- Adjust Santa Claus ornament configuration\n- Update the sealing collider, art museum display, and elevator lobby display area.\n- Update lobby lighting and Halloween lighting\n- Update marketing drone display icon\n- Replace billboard video\n- Destroy items directly after receiving them from the mailbox\n\n## Bug Fixes\n- Fixed abnormal position of room recycling device\n- Fixed slot machine poster not loading and reward icon missing\n- Fix Spider Boss dying early and not opening the door\n- Fix giant not disappearing upon death\n- Fix weapon hiding abnormality\n- Fixed abnormal laser trigger response\n- Fix issue with small frame display hierarchy\n\n## Content Adjustments\n- Discarded giant death animation", "created_date": 1793360048, "id": "28781102991561224", "version": "1.16.12", "version_code": 432, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "28781089628229227"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24653500707654827", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28781102991561224"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "4201197503539639"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1790589664, "id": "28349679221370272", "version": "1.15.15a", "version_code": 419, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "28349673574704170"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24653500707654827", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28781102991561224"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1790065404, "id": "28271752615829600", "version": "1.15.15", "version_code": 418, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "28271745389163656"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24653500707654827", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28781102991561224"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "4201197503539639"}]}, "change_log": "Add and optimize\nImprove the accuracy of the room ports used to generate the levels and improve the stability of the map mosaics.\nOptimize monster navigation by using something something.\nThe polling lottery mechanism is changed to the polling mode to improve the interaction smoothness.\nIncreasing detection of treasure-generating points to prevent invalid generation.\nInclusion value and damage text support visual range, optimize performance.\nElevators (public/private) have been added to improve player tracking stability.\n\nFixed\nFix the slot machine room.\nFix the grey room editor test problem.\nFixed an open-eye problem before the body was destroyed.\nFixed a broken wire in the shotgun firing mechanism.\nFixed a problem with the Crown Network Sync sequence.\nRepair of the overall displacement caused by the? Room variant.\nFixed a temporary problem (blocked anomaly) where all artifacts disappeared.\nFixed a bug caused by a laser trap emitter.\nFixed a problem where the magma in the room didn't collide and do no damage.\nFixed time mines and hand grenades that could still fit in a backpack.\nFixed the geometry black box.\nFixed a problem where some of the balls were not removed correctly from the room.\n\nSystems and performance\nFix some of the renderers that were destroyed in the middle of the process.\nOptimize the physical cache pressure.\nOptimize the data structure of players entering the room.\n\nKnown problems: no major known problems. It is recommended to update to this version for stability.", "created_date": 1788512215, "id": "28030722316599299", "version": "1.15.14g", "version_code": 417, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "28030715016600029"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24653500707654827", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28781102991561224"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "4201197503539639"}]}, "change_log": "Add and optimize\nOptimize elevator synchronization and interaction.\nIncrease the thickness of the adaptive passageway wall to improve structural stability.\nEnable minimap.\nAccess flight effects to optimize visual performance.\nMatching room timeout (30 seconds) automatically exits, improving the matching experience.\nSupport for entering test scenarios for easy debugging.\nNew Decorations, marketing resources, and multi-language updates for the new semester.\nSearch and destroy mode map door has been added to optimize the damage effect.\nFixed\nFixed a problem that set damage that could be reported incorrectly.\nFixed an issue where the cat and snake panel text was out of bounds and the delivery logic was out of whack.\nFixed a white-clad female ghost effect and lava collision.\nFixed an undestroyed shuttle in the lobby, an elevator collision anomaly, and a private elevator that couldn't move when activated.\nFix match display error, room list text overframe.\nFixed resource loss, precast index loss, map merge data loss, etc. .\nFix flashlight lighting, volume adjustment, voice issues.\nSystems and performance\nUpgrade shaders, optimize ambient reflections, Highlights, and metallic shine, and increase rendering efficiency.\nOptimize occlusion culling, material instantiation, and mesh merging.\nUpdate the role physical controller to improve platform movement, steering, crawling, and delivery logic.\nAdjust the trigger strategy and conditions of monster attacks to improve combat performance.\nOptimize the persistent character flow, support scene switching to retain the role of state.\nProcesses and interactions\nImprove the spacecraft take-off, landing and switching processes, to match the generated levels adjusted to\u201cLanding\u201d after completion.\nOptimize the hall-to-level, death/resurrection logic to increase the sense of immersion.\nImproved lift carrier to move players around and avoid wearing moulds.\nRemove unnecessary images from lobby, death, tutorial and other scenes, and make the interface simpler.\nOne-person joystick access, more options.", "created_date": 1787829261, "id": "27927679666903565", "version": "1.15.14", "version_code": 410, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "27927671513571047"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}